  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Media Support (IMS) Christmas Calender Project Children set the Agenda in a world of Fake News 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure the creation of a network of media run by children and youths to serve and inform eight communities in traditionally marginalised areas of the country. IMS will work together with Tunisian non-governmental organisation Al Khatt and its youth citizen reporter network that works closely together with state-run youth centres across the country. The project will establish eight new youth-run community media outlets, train them and equip them with adequate tools and skills to produce verified public interest information targeting their direct communities.</narrative>
  </description>
